 • Usability: Simple and intuitive web interface for viewing and updating 
scores.
 • Scalability: Able to handle increasing numbers of players and competitions.
 • Performance: Leaderboard updates and data retrieval must be fast.
 3. System Requirements
• Software: XAMPP or WAMP server (Apache + MySQL + PHP), web 
browser.
 • Hardware: Standard computer with internet access for testing.
 • Database: MySQL for managing relational data of players, competitions, and 
scores.
